{"product_id":"right-behind-you","title":"Right Behind You","description":"\u003cp\u003eSome doors should not be opened.Some can never be closed.Jo Palmer's peaceful and happy life is about to end.Ash - the man she loves - will be arrested by the police.Millie - her precious daughter - will be taken from her.She will lose her friends.She will doubt her sanity.Someone is stealing everything Jo loves, and will stop at nothing.But right now, Jo is laughing in her kitchen, eating dinner with her family, suspecting nothing.It's raining outside.There's a knock at the door. They are here.A DCI Tom Douglas thriller\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 203\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Rachel Abbott\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781999943738\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 396\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45590028189849,"sku":"7RC9781999943738","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/687f49f4beb49_Right_Behind_You_Rachel_Abbott.jpg?v=1753176999","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/right-behind-you","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}